@ Scoped archive/model name remapping (code/framework/name_remap.cpp).
@ Both entries are `push` instructions, position-independent, so the
@ trampolines can replay them (reverse-engineering/FindingsF/data/hookable.csv).

NameRemap_archiveGet:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x0043B548
    symbol:     ModBase::nameRemap::archiveGet(void*, ModBase::nameRemap::SafeStr*)
    trampoline: ModBase::nameRemap::archiveGet_orig(void*, ModBase::nameRemap::SafeStr*)

NameRemap_getModel:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x00430090
    symbol:     ModBase::nameRemap::getModel(void*, ModBase::nameRemap::SafeStr*, unsigned int, unsigned int, unsigned int, unsigned int, unsigned int, bool, void*)
    trampoline: ModBase::nameRemap::getModel_orig(void*, ModBase::nameRemap::SafeStr*, unsigned int, unsigned int, unsigned int, unsigned int, unsigned int, bool, void*)
